Original result being reconstructed
===================================

F004 is Malcolm Hoong Wai Chen, Abstract regular polytopes of G2(q) in even
characteristic, arXiv:2609.25004v1, submitted 21 September 2026.
Primary text: https://arxiv.org/html/2609.25004v1

Section 4 and Table 2 include the finite census for 3<=q<=11. The q=11 row
reports 105 rank four representations up to isomorphism and duality, and
none in higher ranks. The even-characteristic construction is a separate
part of the paper. The job/position numbers in our certificates refer to
our retained candidate domain, rather than the numbering of published
positive examples.

The two new NG certificates fill gaps in this reconstruction. They do not
disprove the reported census. The known ambient model, group meaning and
order bound remain explicitly attributed inputs.
